ordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kqGpvY cmTzNW pf-8869ceba78ce-19_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="a5b3a145-43c4-4895-8971-353a8b8e8511" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>Is your meat free from mRNA vaccines?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-dxcExB boHSLB pf-8869ceba78ce-21_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-ijaoyg fLgXwO pf-8869ceba78ce-22_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-8869ceba78ce-23_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Yes. Our meat comes from animals that have never received mRNA vaccines.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-kRRxPL iQTArD pf-8869ceba78ce-25_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kqGpvY cmTzNW pf-8869ceba78ce-26_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="95497135-3a8b-4e85-91a9-6fe74e6b3c32" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>Do you use antibiotics or added hormones?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-dxcExB boHSLB pf-8869ceba78ce-28_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-ijaoyg fLgXwO pf-8869ceba78ce-29_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-8869ceba78ce-30_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">No. Our animals are raised without added hormones or routine antibiotics.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-kRRxPL iQTArD pf-8869ceba78ce-32_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kqGpvY cmTzNW pf-8869ceba78ce-33_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="8511a96f-e74e-4b3c-b238-872cd42efda3" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>How is your meat shipped?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-dxcExB boHSLB pf-8869ceba78ce-35_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-ijaoyg fLgXwO pf-8869ceba78ce-36_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-8869ceba78ce-37_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We ship frozen meat nationwide in insulated packaging with dry ice designed to keep your order cold during transit.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-kRRxPL iQTArD pf-8869ceba78ce-39_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kqGpvY cmTzNW pf-8869ceba78ce-40_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="3c323887-2cd4-4efd-a34e-2472d1891a87" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c