 pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="1a8737a5-6542-4a7b-8314-b2bd58785ad8" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>Why does your meat taste different than grocery store meat?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-dxcExB boHSLB pf-8869ceba78ce-56_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-ijaoyg fLgXwO pf-8869ceba78ce-57_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-8869ceba78ce-58_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Most grocery store meat travels through a long supply chain before reaching your plate. Our meat is carefully sourced, expertly butchered, vacuum-sealed, and shipped directly to your home, resulting in exceptional flavor and quality.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-kRRxPL iQTArD pf-8869ceba78ce-60_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kqGpvY cmTzNW pf-8869ceba78ce-61_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="7bc314b2-bd58-485a-9877-20632d8869ce" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>Where do you ship?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-dxcExB boHSLB pf-8869ceba78ce-63_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class